 0px; border: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline\"> </span>who were artists</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[[\"mining\"],[\"education\"],[\"notes\"],[\"journals\"],[\"Venice\"],[\"canteen\"],[\"friends\"]]',NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"Gwendoline and Margaret Davies\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,1,NULL,'<table border=\"1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0)\" cellpadding=\"5pt\" style=\"border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; text-indent: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: Geologica, sans; width: 880.667px; table-layout: auto; margin-top: 2em; margin-bottom: 2em; font-size: 0.875em; line-height: 1.71429; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247)\"><tbody style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235)\"><tr style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 229, 229); border-image: none; height: 0pt\"><td style=\"border: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; width: 441.865px\"><p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Geologica, sans !important\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-size: 16px; font-family: Geologica, sans !important\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 600; color: rgb(23, 23, 23); font-family: Geologica, sans !important\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">Câu 1: </span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 229, 153); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">their grandfather’s</span> <span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-fami