yle=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">=&gt; Đáp án là <span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 600; color: rgb(23, 23, 23); font-family: Geologica, sans !important\">NOT GIVEN</span></span></p></td><td style=\"border: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; width: 437.469px\"><p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Geologica, sans !important\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">Đoạn 7:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Geologica, sans !important\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-size: 16px; font-family: Geologica, sans !important\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">Yet on one of numerous trips to nearby Paris, she visited </span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(234, 209, 220); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">the Bernheim-Jeune Gallery. Here </span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">she acquired </span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(182, 215, 168); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">two works by Cezanne – Provencal Landscape and The Francois Zola Dam. T</span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">he paintings were shipped directly to Bath, England, where they became the first works by Cezanne to </span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\">go on display in a public gallery</span><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap\"> in Britain.&nbsp;</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>',NULL,NULL,0,1784100408,NULL,NULL,NULL),(815,263,264,414,6,6,'multiple_choice','<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px\">The impact of the First World War encouraged Gwendoline to reconsider her interest in collecting art.</span>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'True',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,1,NULL,'<table border=\"1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0)\" cellpadding=\"5pt\" style=\"border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; text-indent: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: Geologica, sans; width: 880.667px; table-layout: auto; margin-top: 2em; margin-bottom: 2em; font-size: 0.875em; line-height: 1.71429; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247)\"><tbody style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235)\"><tr style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 229, 229); border-