-weight: normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">According to Justin Feinstein, flotation tanks allow people to concentrate on their own ___</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">, which helps them relax and enables them to meditate.</span></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px 0px 1em; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">Feinstein and his colleagues conducted an experiment in which 50 people, who were all suffering from stress and related issues, were given a&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">___&nbsp;to complete before and after using a flotation tank. Participants reported a reduction in their symptoms after an hour in the tank, together with signs of relaxation and improved general&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">___.</span></span></p><p style=\"border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">In another experiment, the researchers had 48 people spend periods of 90 minutes either lying back in a chair or floating in a tank. Brain scans then revealed that those people who had been in a tank had decreased activity in parts of the brain associated with&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">___.</span></span></p></h3>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[[\"breath\"],[\"questionnaire\"],[\"wellbeing\"],[\"depression\"]]',NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"Flotation Tanks\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1784100408,NULL,NULL,NULL),(822,263,265,417,13,13,'drag_drop_reuse','<p style=\"padding: 0px 0px 1em; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\"><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">It is unpleasant and upsetting for people to be placed in a silent environment against their will. ___</span></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px 0px 1em; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\"><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">The trend towards creating quieter urban locations is likely to increase in the coming years. ___</span></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px 0px 1em; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\"><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">When our body\'s senses are completely deprived of input, our minds compensate for this by creating the illusion of images and sounds. ___</span></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px 0px 1em; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\"><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">Even a short amount of silent time can have a positive impact. ___</span></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px 0px 1em; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\"Open Sans\", Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: large; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\"><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent\">&nb