L,NULL,NULL,0,1787232730,NULL,NULL,NULL),(14741,1385,3455,6513,5,5,'multiple_choice','cau 4',NULL,NULL,NULL,'C',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"A\":\"A\",\"B\":\"B\",\"C\":\"C\"}',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787232730,NULL,NULL,NULL),(14742,1386,3456,6514,6,6,'note_completion','<p>Dưới đây là một đoạn bài tập <b>Note Completion</b> mẫu chuẩn định dạng IELTS Reading Passage 1:</p><hr><p><b>Questions 1–6</b></p><p><i>Complete the notes below.</i></p><p><i>Choose <b>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</b> from the passage for each answer.</i></p><h3>The History of Tea in Britain</h3><ul><li><p><b>Early Introduction:</b></p><ul><li><p>Tea was first brought to Britain in the 17th century by traders from <b>1</b> ____________.</p></li><li><p>Initially, it was considered a luxury item and was mainly consumed by the <b>2</b> ____________.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><b>Taxation &amp; Smuggling:</b></p><ul><li><p>High government taxes made tea extremely expensive, leading to a rise in illegal <b>3</b> ____________.</p></li><li><p>In 1784, the tax was significantly reduced, making tea affordable for the general public.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><b>Social Impact:</b></p><ul><li><p>Tea houses became popular social hubs, particularly for <b>4</b> ____________ who were often excluded from coffee houses.</p></li><li><p>The invention of the <b>5</b> ____________ in the 19th century further revolutionized how tea was served and enjoyed.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><b>Modern Consumption:</b></p><ul><li><p>Today, approximately <b>6</b> ____________ million cups of tea are consumed daily across the UK.</p></li></ul></li></ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[[\"china\"],[\"wealthy\"],[\"smuggling\"],[\"women\"],[\"teabag\"],[\"100\"]]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787232730,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15495,1467,3656,6775,1,1,'essay','<span style=\"color: rgb(18, 31, 62); white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251)\">Do you think you currently have a good balance between your work or study and your personal life?</span>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"01.\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15496,1467,3656,6775,2,2,'essay','<li style=\"color: rgb(18, 31, 62); white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251)\"><p>How many hours a day do you usually spend working or studying?</p></li><li style=\"color: rgb(18, 31, 62); white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251)\"></li>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15497,1467,3656,6775,3,3,'essay','<span style=\"color: rgb(18, 31, 62); white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251)\">What do you usually do to relax after a busy day?</span>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15498,1467,3656,6776,4,4,'essay','<li><p>Do you think people have less free time now compared to the past?</p></li><li><p></p></li>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15499,1467,3656,6776,5,5,'essay','Would you like to change anything about your current daily routine?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15500,1467,3657,6777,6,6,'essay','<p>Describe a time when you struggled to manage your time between work/study and personal life</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px !important\">You should say:</p><ul style=\"margin: 0px\"><li style=\"list-style: none\"><p>What the situation was</p></li><li style=\"list-style: none\"><p>What you had to do during that time</p></li><li style=\"list-style: none\"><p>How you felt about the experience</p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px !important\">And explain how you resolved the situation to achieve a better balance.</p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(18, 31, 62); white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251)\"></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,'<p>I’d like to tell you about a time last year when my schedule was just a total mess! I was handling a huge project launch at work while also taking an intensive evening course, and the deadlines hit me all at the exact same time.</p><p>During those two weeks, I was basically working non-stop from early morning until late at night. I had to pull late-nighters just to keep up, and I barely had time to eat decent meals, let alone see my family or friends. I had to cancel all my weekend plans, which sucked! Mentally, I was completely drained and constantly worried that I was going to mess something up because of how exhausted I was.</p><p>Eventually, I realized I couldn\'t keep going like that. I sat down and made a strict digital checklist, prioritizing only the most urgent tasks and ignoring minor distractions. I also talked to my supervisor and asked for a bit of extra time on a few minor reports. Setting those clear boundaries saved me, and I managed to finish everything without losing my sanity!</p>',NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15501,1467,3658,6778,7,7,'essay','Why is it becoming increasingly difficult for modern workers to maintain a healthy work-life balance?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"11\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,'Smartphones make it hard to disconnect because employers expect quick replies even after working hours.',NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15502,1467,3658,6778,8,8,'essay','<p>Do you think employers should be legally required to limit working hours and prevent employees from answering work emails after hours ?</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"12\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,'However, some industries require flexibility, so rigid laws might create friction for urgent project demands.',NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15503,1467,3658,6778,9,9,'essay','How has the rise of remote work and digital technology impacted the boundary between personal life and professional responsibilities?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"13\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,'<li><p>Working from home removes the physical divide between the office and home, making it tempting to work all day.</p></li><li><p></p></li>',NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15504,1467,3658,6779,10,10,'essay','In what ways might society\'s definition of \"success\" need to change to promote better well-being for individuals?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"14\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,'Success should be measured by personal happiness and mental health rather than just monetary wealth or high status',NULL,NULL,0,1787816617,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15505,1468,3659,6780,1,1,'essay','<p><span><b>The graph below gives information on the numbers of participants for different activities at one social centre in Melbourne, Australia for the period 2000 to 2020.</b></span></p><p><span><b>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</b></span></p><p><span><br></span> \n<br style=\"font-variant: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto\"></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1787817013,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15506,1468,3659,6781,2,2,'essay','<p><b>Some people think that competition at work, at school and in daily life is a good thing. Others believe that we should try to cooperate more, rather than competing against each other.</b></p><p><b>Discuss both these views and give your own opinion.</b></p><p><br></p><p>Give reasons for your answer and include any relevant examples from your own knowledge or experience.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\"></span> \n<br style=\"font-variant: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto\"></p>