e: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Bước 3:</u></span> Tìm các keywords được paraphrase trong bài:</span></p><ul style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); list-style-position: inside; list-style-type: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px\"><li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); position: relative; padding-left: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">wound around</span> ~ vị trí xích quấn quanh trong sơ đồ</span></li><li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); position: relative; padding-left: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">top of the hill / bottom of the hill</span> ~ vị trí trên sơ đồ</span></li></ul><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Bước 4:</u></span> So sánh và đối chiếu:</span></p><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\"></div><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\">Bài đọc nêu \"</span><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\">The chain is fastened in a loop, which is <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">wound around</span> a <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">gear</span> at the <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">top of the hill</span> and another one at the <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">bottom of the hill</span></span><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\">\" (Tạm dịch: Sợi xích được nối thành vòng, <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">quấn quanh</span> một <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">bánh răng</span> ở <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">đỉnh dốc</span> và một bánh răng khác ở <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">chân dốc</span>).</span><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\"></div><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\">==&gt; Bộ phận được thể hiện trong sơ đồ chính là \"gear\".</span></div>',NULL,NULL,0,1789658708,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15976,1535,3783,6915,21,21,'diagram_labeling','___',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[[\"motor\"]]',NULL,NULL,'{\"title\":\"Question 16\"}','[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.2,1,NULL,'<div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: rgb(33, 53, 71); font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25rem; color: rgb(29, 29, 31); text-indent: unset !important\">Câu 16 - Giải thích đáp án</span></div><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25rem; color: rgb(29, 29, 31); font-family: Nunito, sans-serif\"><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Đáp án:</u></span> motor</span></p><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\"></div>&nbsp;<p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"></p><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Bước 1:</u></span> Hiểu câu hỏi và Giải thích ngữ pháp:</span></p><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\"></div><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\">Vị trí số 16 chỉ bộ phận làm quay bánh răng ở chân dốc, tạo lực để kéo xích chuyển động.</span><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"></p><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Bước 2:</u></span> Xác định loại từ dựa trên các dấu hiệu:</span></p><ul style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); list-style-position: inside; list-style-type: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px\"><li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); position: relative; padding-left: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">Loại từ</span>: Danh từ</span></li><li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); position: relative; padding-left: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">Dấu hiệu</span>: Là bộ phận cung cấp năng lượng, cần một danh từ đơn theo yêu cầu đề bài.</span></li></ul><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Bước 3:</u></span> Tìm các keywords được paraphrase trong bài:</span></p><ul style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); list-style-position: inside; list-style-type: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px\"><li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); position: relative; padding-left: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">turned by</span> ~ bộ phận làm bánh răng quay</span></li><li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); position: relative; padding-left: 16px\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">gear at the bottom of the hill</span> ~ vị trí trong sơ đồ</span></li></ul><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; text-indent: unset !important\"><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\"><u style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235)\">Bước 4:</u></span> So sánh và đối chiếu:</span></p><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\"></div><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; text-indent: unset !important\">Bài đọc nêu \"</span><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; text-indent: unset !important\">The <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">gear at the bottom of the hill</span> is <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">turned by</span> a <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">motor</span></span><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; text-indent: unset !important\">\" (Tạm dịch: <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">Bánh răng ở chân dốc được quay</span> <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">bởi một</span> <span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700\">động cơ</span>).</span><div style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\"></div><span style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; text-indent: unset !important\">==&gt; Bộ phận cung cấp lực quay chính là \"motor\".</span></div>',NULL,NULL,0,1789658708,NULL,NULL,NULL);
