e-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">decomposers</span>. Unlike plants, which produce their own food through photosynthesis, or animals, which ingest food, fungi secrete powerful enzymes into their environment. These enzymes break down complex organic matter – dead plants, animals, and waste products – into simpler substances, which the fungi then absorb. This process is crucial for recycling nutrients, making them available for other organisms, and thus maintaining the fertility of soils worldwide. Without fungi, the Earth would be buried under mountains of undecomposed organic debris.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">Beyond decomposition, fungi form a myriad of fascinating symbiotic relationships. The most widespread are&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">mycorrhizal associations</span>, where fungi live in close proximity to plant roots. In this mutually beneficial partnership, the fungus extends its hyphae (root-like structures) far into the soil, vastly increasing the plant’s access to water and essential nutrients like phosphorus and nitrogen. In return, the plant provides the fungus with carbohydrates produced during photosynthesis. This relationship is so vital that an estimated 90% of all plant species, including most crops, rely on mycorrhizal fungi for optimal growth.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">Lichens, another remarkable symbiotic entity, are a partnership between a fungus and an alga (or cyanobacterium). Here, the fungus provides a protective structure, moisture, and minerals, while the alga performs photosynthesis, supplying food for both. Lichens are incredible pioneers, capable of colonizing harsh environments like bare rock, where they slowly contribute to soil formation.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">The economic and medical importance of fungi is equally profound. Yeasts are fundamental to baking and brewing industries. Penicillin, the first widely used antibiotic, was discovered from the fungus&nbsp;<i style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Penicillium chrysogenum</i>, revolutionizing medicine. Fungi are also increasingly used in bioremediation, helping clean up oil spills and other pollutants. Despite their immense contributions, many fungal species remain a mystery, underscoring the vast potential yet to be uncovered in this silent, powerful kingdom.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',4,'2026-01-04 21:24:05','2026-01-07 07:25:22',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(6,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Reading',NULL,'The Wonders of Bio-Luminescence – Nature’s Living Lights',NULL,'<p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">A Dazzling Display of Evolution</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">Bio-luminescence, the emission of light by living organisms, is one of nature’s most enchanting phenomena. From the ethereal glow of fireflies on a summer night to the eerie deep-sea lights of anglerfish, this natural light production is widespread across various taxa, particularly in marine environments. While fascinating to observe, bio-luminescence is far from mere spectacle; it serves a crucial array of ecological purposes, honed over millions of years of evolution.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">At its core, bio-luminescence is a chemical reaction. It typically involves a molecule called luciferin, which emits light when it reacts with oxygen, catalyzed by an enzyme known as luciferase. The specific structure of luciferin and luciferase varies greatly among different species, leading to a diverse palette of light colors – from blue and green, which travel furthest in water, to yellow and red, less common but still vital in certain contexts. The efficiency of this process is remarkable; almost 100% of the energy is converted into light, with very little heat produced, making it a “cold light.”</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">The functions of bio-luminescence are as varied as the organisms that produce it. In many cases, it is used for&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">communication</span>. Fireflies use distinct flash patterns to attract mates, while some deep-sea squid deploy glowing ink as a decoy to confuse predators. For&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">predation</span>, specialized anglerfish use a bio-luminescent lure dangling from their heads to entice unsuspecting prey in the dark depths. Conversely, bio-luminescence also serves as a potent&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">defense mechanism</span>. Some jellyfish emit sudden flashes to startle attackers, and various planktonic organisms glow when disturbed, creating a “burglar alarm” effect that attracts larger predators of their own attackers.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">Marine environments, especially the abyssal zone where sunlight never penetrates, are particularly rich in bio-luminescent life. Here, light is not just useful, but often essential for survival. The vast majority of deep-sea creatures, from tiny crustaceans to giant squid, exhibit some form of bio-luminescence. Even terrestrial environments host glowing organisms, though less abundantly, primarily insects, fungi, and some microorganisms.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">Ongoing research into bio-luminescence continues to reveal its secrets. Scientists are exploring its potential applications in various fields, including medicine (as markers in cellular imaging), environmental monitoring (detecting pollutants), and even sustainable lighting solutions. Understanding how nature produces light so efficiently without heat could inspire revolutionary technologies, further cementing bio-luminescence as one of the planet’s most valuable biological wonders.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 00:22:14','2026-01-05 21:38:37','2026-01-05 21:38:37',NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(7,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo 001',NULL,'The Rise of Digital Nomads – Work, Life, and Wanderlust in the 21st Century',NULL,'<p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The Untethered Workforce</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">The concept of work has undergone a radical transformation in the 21st century. No longer confined to the traditional office cubicle, a growing segment of the global workforce is embracing a lifestyle that blends professional responsibilities with constant travel: the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">digital nomad</span>. These individuals leverage technology – primarily laptops, smartphones, and reliable internet access – to perform their jobs remotely, enabling them to live and work from virtually anywhere in the world.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">The emergence of digital nomadism is a confluence of several factors. Firstly, the rapid advancement of technology, particularly cloud computing and video conferencing tools, has made remote collaboration seamless and efficient. Secondly, a shifting cultural perspective prioritizes experiences and personal freedom over traditional career paths and material possessions. Finally, the increasing cost of living in major cities, coupled with the desire for a better work-life balance, has driven many to seek more affordable locations and flexible schedules.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">While the appeal of this lifestyle is undeniable – imagine working from a beach in Bali or a mountain cabin in Switzerland – it comes with its own unique set of challenges. Digital nomads often grapple with issues like maintaining stable internet connections in remote areas, managing different time zones for client meetings, and navigating visa and tax complexities across various countries. Loneliness and the lack of a consistent social support system can also be significant hurdles, as fleeting interactions replace deeper community ties.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">Despite these challenges, the digital nomad movement continues to grow, attracting professionals from a wide range of industries, including web development, graphic design, content writing, online marketing, and virtual assistance. Governments and local economies are increasingly recognizing the potential benefits of this trend, with some countries even offering special “digital nomad visas” to attract these high-skilled, self-sufficient individuals who contribute to the local economy without competing for local jobs.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Plus Jakarta Sans&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">The future of work is undoubtedly leaning towards greater flexibility and remote possibilities, and digital nomadism stands as a prominent example of this evolution. As technology continues to improve and societal norms adapt, it’s likely that this untethered approach to work will become an even more integrated and accepted part of the global economy, reshaping not only how we work but also where and how we live.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'question_bank/images/ORkxbmnRGeFpcfjbnpqvXdk7fIL28JvAMLm2RYJ6.jpg',7.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 09:35:51','2026-01-10 04:19:11',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(8,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo 002',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.5,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 09:42:53','2026-01-05 09:42:53',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(9,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','listening',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo 002',NULL,'demo 002',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'question_bank/audio/nb68j3bAfT0l3xiH3tGI4JgcSFyb2QKYEF5llPyc.mp3',NULL,6.5,NULL,NULL,'beginner',1,'2026-01-05 09:43:18','2026-09-17 14:02:00',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(10,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','writing','task1_letter',NULL,NULL,'Demo003',NULL,'You should spend about 20 minutes on this task. Write at least 150 words.',NULL,'<div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>You live in a room in college which you share with another student.</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>However, there are many problems with this arrangement and you find it</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>very difficult to work.</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>Write a letter to the accommodation officer at the college. In your letter</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b><br></b></font></div><ul><li><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>&nbsp; - describe the situation</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>&nbsp; - explain your problems and why it is difficult to work</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>&nbsp; - say what kind of accommodation you would prefer</b></font></div></li></ul><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">You do NOT need to write any addresses.</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">Begin your letter as follows:</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">Dear Sir or Madam</font></div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5.5,NULL,NULL,'beginner',2,'2026-01-05 09:50:07','2026-01-10 04:35:10',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(11,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo004',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 09:51:24','2026-01-06 01:13:46','2026-01-06 01:13:46',NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(12,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo004',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 10:16:11','2026-01-06 01:15:24','2026-01-06 01:15:24',NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(13,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo004',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 10:19:43','2026-01-05 10:19:43',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(14,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo004',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-05 10:20:20','2026-01-05 10:20:20',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15,NULL,NULL,1,'mock','listening','multiple_choice',NULL,NULL,'Listening Questions (Migrated)','Auto-migrated from standalone questions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'intermediate',0,'2026-01-05 21:30:49','2026-01-05 21:30:49',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(16,NULL,NULL,1,'mock','reading','true_false_not_given',NULL,NULL,'Reading Questions (Migrated)','Auto-migrated from standalone questions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'intermediate',0,'2026-01-05 21:30:49','2026-01-05 21:30:49',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(17,NULL,NULL,1,'mock','writing','graph_description',NULL,NULL,'Writing Questions (Migrated)','Auto-migrated from standalone questions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'intermediate',0,'2026-01-05 21:30:49','2026-01-05 21:30:49',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(18,NULL,NULL,1,'mock','speaking','speaking_prompt',NULL,NULL,'Speaking Questions (Migrated)','Auto-migrated from standalone questions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'intermediate',0,'2026-01-05 21:30:49','2026-01-05 21:30:49',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(19,NULL,NULL,1,'practice','reading','multiple_choice',NULL,NULL,'Reading Practice (Migrated)','Auto-migrated from standalone questions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'intermediate',0,'2026-01-05 21:30:49','2026-01-10 04:51:24',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'rejected',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'deo thich'),(20,NULL,NULL,1,'practice','listening','fill_blank',NULL,NULL,'Listening Practice (Migrated)','Auto-migrated from standalone questions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'intermediate',0,'2026-01-05 21:30:49','2026-01-06 08:46:54',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'rejected',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'không hợp lệ'),(21,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p><b>The Science Behind Our Slumber</b></p><p><br></p><p>Sleep is a fundamental human need, as vital to our health as eating, drinking, and breathing. It’s a complex, dynamic state rather than a passive one. For centuries, the exact purpose and mechanisms of sleep remained largely a mystery. However, advancements in neuroscience and sleep research over the past few decades have shed considerable light on this enigmatic process, revealing its profound impact on our physical and mental well-being.</p><p><br></p><p>Scientists typically divide sleep into two basic types: Rapid Eye Movement (REM) sleep and non-Rapid Eye Movement (NREM) sleep. NREM sleep is further categorized into three stages, each progressively deeper. Stage 1 NREM is a light sleep, a transition from wakefulness. Stage 2 NREM is characterized by a slower heart rate and a drop in body temperature. Stage 3 NREM, often referred to as “deep sleep” or “slow-wave sleep,” is the most restorative stage, crucial for physical recovery and growth. During this stage, brain waves slow significantly, and it’s hardest to awaken someone.</p><p><br></p><p>REM sleep, on the other hand, is the stage where most dreaming occurs. Despite the body being largely paralyzed (a protective mechanism to prevent us from acting out our dreams), brain activity during REM sleep is remarkably similar to that of wakefulness. This stage is particularly important for cognitive functions, including memory consolidation, learning, and emotional processing. A typical night’s sleep involves cycling through these NREM and REM stages multiple times, with each cycle lasting approximately 90-110 minutes. Early in the night, NREM deep sleep dominates, while REM sleep periods become longer towards morning.</p><p><br></p><p>The benefits of adequate sleep are vast and multifaceted. Physically, sleep allows the body to repair and regenerate, strengthening the immune system and regulating hormones essential for appetite and metabolism. Mentally, it clears the mind, enhances problem-solving skills, and improves concentration and mood. Chronic sleep deprivation, conversely, has detrimental effects, ranging from impaired cognitive function and reduced productivity to an increased risk of serious health conditions like obesity, diabetes, and cardiovascular disease. Understanding these intricate processes is key to appreciating sleep not as a luxury, but as an indispensable pillar of a healthy life.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.5,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-06 19:24:12','2026-01-06 19:25:12',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(22,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo009',NULL,'SpeakingDemo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-07 21:14:45','2026-01-07 21:14:45',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(23,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking','part2',NULL,NULL,'Demo009',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5.5,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-07 21:21:15','2026-01-07 21:21:15',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(24,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','speaking','part2',NULL,NULL,'Demo009',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div><b>Candidate Task Card</b></div><div><b>Describe something you own which is very important to you.</b></div><div><b>&nbsp;You should say:</b></div><div><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; where you got it from</b></div><div><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; how long you have had it</b></div><div><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; what you use it for</b></div><div><b>and explain why it is important to you.</b></div><div>You will have to talk about the topic for 1 to 2 minutes.</div><div>You have one minute to think about what you\'re going to say.</div><div>You can make some notes to help you if you wish.</div><div><br></div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'beginner',1,'2026-01-07 21:44:06','2026-01-08 01:49:26',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(25,NULL,NULL,1049,'practice','reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo009 Reading',NULL,'The Wonders of Bio-Luminescence – Nature’s Living Lights',NULL,'<p><b>The Untethered Workforce</b></p><p>The concept of work has undergone a radical transformation in the 21st century. No longer confined to the traditional office cubicle, a growing segment of the global workforce is embracing a lifestyle that blends professional responsibilities with constant travel: the <b>digital nomad</b>. These individuals leverage technology – primarily laptops, smartphones, and reliable internet access – to perform their jobs remotely, enabling them to live and work from virtually anywhere in the world.</p><p>The emergence of digital nomadism is a confluence of several factors. Firstly, the rapid advancement of technology, particularly cloud computing and video conferencing tools, has made remote collaboration seamless and efficient. Secondly, a shifting cultural perspective prioritizes experiences and personal freedom over traditional career paths and material possessions. Finally, the increasing cost of living in major cities, coupled with the desire for a better work-life balance, has driven many to seek more affordable locations and flexible schedules.</p><p>While the appeal of this lifestyle is undeniable – imagine working from a beach in Bali or a mountain cabin in Switzerland – it comes with its own unique set of challenges. Digital nomads often grapple with issues like maintaining stable internet connections in remote areas, managing different time zones for client meetings, and navigating visa and tax complexities across various countries. Loneliness and the lack of a consistent social support system can also be significant hurdles, as fleeting interactions replace deeper community ties.</p><p>Despite these challenges, the digital nomad movement continues to grow, attracting professionals from a wide range of industries, including web development, graphic design, content writing, online marketing, and virtual assistance. Governments and local economies are increasingly recognizing the potential benefits of this trend, with some countries even offering special “digital nomad visas” to attract these high-skilled, self-sufficient individuals who contribute to the local economy without competing for local jobs.</p><p>The future of work is undoubtedly leaning towards greater flexibility and remote possibilities, and digital nomadism stands as a prominent example of this evolution. As technology continues to improve and societal norms adapt, it’s likely that this untethered approach to work will become an even more integrated and accepted part of the global economy, reshaping not only how we work but also where and how we live.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',1,'2026-01-07 23:52:13','2026-01-25 20:18:18',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(26,NULL,NULL,1049,'mock','listening',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo mock test',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'question_bank/audio/7HufgGRGdI8gysjFVFEX7yMStIEVMgP4TiQKEJ5U.mp3',NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-09 01:54:57','2026-09-17 14:02:00',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(27,NULL,NULL,1049,'mock','reading',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo mock test',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p><b>&nbsp;The Science Behind Our Slumber</b></p><p><br></p><p>Sleep is a fundamental human need, as vital to our health as eating, drinking, and breathing. It’s a complex, dynamic state rather than a passive one. For centuries, the exact purpose and mechanisms of sleep remained largely a mystery. However, advancements in neuroscience and sleep research over the past few decades have shed considerable light on this enigmatic process, revealing its profound impact on our physical and mental well-being.</p><p><br></p><p>Scientists typically divide sleep into two basic types: Rapid Eye Movement (REM) sleep and non-Rapid Eye Movement (NREM) sleep. NREM sleep is further categorized into three stages, each progressively deeper. Stage 1 NREM is a light sleep, a transition from wakefulness. Stage 2 NREM is characterized by a slower heart rate and a drop in body temperature. Stage 3 NREM, often referred to as “deep sleep” or “slow-wave sleep,” is the most restorative stage, crucial for physical recovery and growth. During this stage, brain waves slow significantly, and it’s hardest to awaken someone.</p><p><br></p><p>REM sleep, on the other hand, is the stage where most dreaming occurs. Despite the body being largely paralyzed (a protective mechanism to prevent us from acting out our dreams), brain activity during REM sleep is remarkably similar to that of wakefulness. This stage is particularly important for cognitive functions, including memory consolidation, learning, and emotional processing. A typical night’s sleep involves cycling through these NREM and REM stages multiple times, with each cycle lasting approximately 90-110 minutes. Early in the night, NREM deep sleep dominates, while REM sleep periods become longer towards morning.</p><p><br></p><p>The benefits of adequate sleep are vast and multifaceted. Physically, sleep allows the body to repair and regenerate, strengthening the immune system and regulating hormones essential for appetite and metabolism. Mentally, it clears the mind, enhances problem-solving skills, and improves concentration and mood. Chronic sleep deprivation, conversely, has detrimental effects, ranging from impaired cognitive function and reduced productivity to an increased risk of serious health conditions like obesity, diabetes, and cardiovascular disease. Understanding these intricate processes is key to appreciating sleep not as a luxury, but as an indispensable pillar of a healthy life.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-09 01:55:27','2026-01-09 01:55:27',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(28,NULL,NULL,1049,'mock','writing',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo Mock test',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>How are you?</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5.5,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-09 01:56:07','2026-01-09 01:56:07',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(29,NULL,NULL,1049,'mock','speaking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Demo Mock test',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.0,NULL,NULL,'beginner',0,'2026-01-09 01:59:03','2026-01-09 01:59:03',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'draft',NU